# Deny-all allowlist: monorepo layouts otherwise leak ../ into the VSIX via vsce.
**/*
../**

# Runtime assets only
!package.json
!LICENSE.txt
!NOTICE.md
!readme.md
!out/
!out/**
!media/
!media/**
!bin/
!bin/**

# Never ship build intermediates even if present under out/
out/**/*.map
out/**/*.d.ts
out/**/*.test.js
**/*.map
**/*.d.ts
**/*.test.js
**/*.ts
**/*.tsx
